            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.4.5

This release makes General settings clear, responsive, and easier to verify.

## What’s improved

- Every General setting now provides immediate visible feedback.
- Dictation sound choices play a short preview when selected.
- Login-item errors now appear directly on the General page.
- Appearance and sound selectors have larger, clearer click targets.
- Removed the misleading Accent Color selector; orange remains Kiki’s consistent product accent.
- Added the installed version and build number beneath “VOICE INTELLIGENCE” in the Settings sidebar.

Transcription speed, quality, and Kiki’s fully local privacy model remain unchanged.
]]></description>
