        <item>
            <title>0.4.2</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 12:23:57 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/tag/v0.4.2</link>
            <sparkle:version>10</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.4.2

This release brings a focused product-polish pass and true live transcription to Meeting Intelligence.

## What’s improved

- Meeting Intelligence now displays a live local transcript while capture is running, then replaces it with the complete source-labelled transcript after processing.
- Unified Meeting controls around one consistent accent color and button system.
- Removed heavy green outlines and glow effects from navigation and selected cards.
- Reworked the Intelligence introduction into a clean, unboxed header.
- Increased button height and horizontal spacing throughout Kiki.
- Rebuilt Personalization Studio surfaces for clear, readable Dark and Light Mode contrast.
- Replaced the Learning page’s harsh split divider with balanced, separated panels.
- Made adaptive panels and transcript surfaces resolve their colors correctly whenever appearance changes.

Transcription and personalization remain fully local to your Mac.
]]></description>
